  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v5.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "1759c2968c906ef1b99653ee34c5b4e5d84a63d04281b9e396ba3341b83a4a49",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cf7ebe5d33071bf308c8471f1b71aa111906b2475c8f05ee82364cb9f2d598ab",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nTiny Tomatoes",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "21aa49763ca606864c95d7dc6545eba30fdda4c02b4abdeb2ec35236fe1a2722",
      "text": "By his front door,\nWukong had a sunny spot.\n“Let’s grow tiny tomatoes!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37d1fa93a76af38433893314d0be57d0ef4803070cdd4232e18938bb16d57450",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought two plants.\nThey dug two little holes.\n“One for you. One for me!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c91ae834b91cceca87266c708334ca1598602350d57d2f4c666103975a7d1a0",
      "text": "In went the plants.\nPat, pat went the soil.\nWukong patted his tummy, too.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3e06dbfacbc3a676a2621dfef676b564202b8ce0eca278c55ff36a5c927041a7",
      "text": "Wukong tipped his little can.\n“A drink for you...”\nOops! A drink for his shoe!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e71a1fca98b159a0a79cd4614fd0b022e2a469aec933a79be46b7ea22d64296",
      "text": "Ao Bing made a tiny cloud. Drip,\ndrip, drip. “Gentle rain!” said\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8fb0bc199f545f51e02b210df89a69ee3201ec1dc8042b6bec35ef39e5962eb4",
      "text": "Each day, they checked the soil.\nDry? A little drink.\nDamp? Time to play!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcfcf4a6993fecd5e091b21818fc69aa61fe391fe50e723fe75f3c315ad4998d",
      "text": "“Red yet?” asked Wukong. He\npeeked under every leaf. Ao Bing\nfound his tickly nose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "03931093de4c3c30617ee395a4c84f8bcdeb4e55b1ed28e406b7d89d06f5b979",
      "text": "Days went by.\nLittle yellow flowers opened.\n“Hello, tiny stars!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e2b6e88574099f5db6b2a8be1d0c299cf17da4d72e6b4a627aea6497fb55c6a5",
      "text": "Then came tiny green tomatoes.\n“Ready?” asked Wukong.\n“Not yet,” said Ao Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "759704c6a5865893649cc405af54a031c7bc28f6a7956a7d6e56878aa48306a4",
      "text": "Wukong whispered, “Please\nturn red.” The tomatoes said\nnothing. Not even a peep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b5b7d5807a4f24c0032078eef5d634544116495c858f38265393ce222950172",
      "text": "They watered. They waited.\nGreen turned to gold.\nGold turned to orange.\n“Almost!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b43b81b7117734787a7a2a5383ccc98a1e37abb582ee2a9362b0655862344355",
      "text": "One morning... red!\nBright, shiny, tomato red!\nWukong did a tiny tomato dance.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c8db74697a00fc78312040b2c85c10675826ffcc77b5a6e86de7784ae91c16b",
      "text": "Twist, lift, plop.\nThey picked the red ones.\nThe green ones stayed to grow.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c25a710cd90f6a63ac29d5593a20ed35839d23a6adcbcc48ce3bba16343e0824",
      "text": "They washed their little harvest.\nRed tomatoes. Cool water.\n“Now we can taste them!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc0d54750168983d61cb9b767d6cb685ac54b62e920a44ffbfd808f8cf7be061",
      "text": "They shared sweet tomato bites.\n“We grew these,” said Wukong.\nAo Bing smiled. “Together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
